  <h2>Prose</h2>
  <article class="prose flow">
    <h2>A prose section</h2>
    <p>This paragraph demonstrates body copy in the prose context. Line height is 1.7, inline-size is capped at <code>--content-max</code> (65ch), and vertical rhythm is handled by the <code>.flow</code> utility.</p>
    <p>A second paragraph. <strong>Bold text</strong> and <em>italic text</em> sit within the rhythm naturally, along with <a href="#">inline links</a>.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Unordered list item one</li>
