  <h2>Flow utility</h2>
  <p>The <code>.flow</code> class applies <code>margin-block-start</code> to every element after the first. Override the gap per-element with <code>--flow-space</code>.</p>
  <div class="flow" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: var(--space-md); border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
    <p>First element — no top margin.</p>
    <p>Second element — default <code>--flow-space</code> (--space-md).</p>
    <p style="--flow-space: var(--space-xl);">Third element — custom <code>--flow-space: var(--space-xl)</code>.</p>
    <p>Fourth element — back to default.</p>
  </div>
